  "slug": "time-off-evaluation-form",
  "title": "Time Off Evaluation Form",
  "subtitle": "Use this evaluation to apply explicit criteria to traceable evidence, calibrate the conclusion, authorize action, and preserve limitations for a time off workflow.",
  "description": "An original operational time off evaluation form that controls a absence request and leave-administration record from identity and routing through evidence, qualified decision, exception management, implementation, handoff, and final verification.",
  "use_case": "Use when the employee, manager, scheduler, or leave administrator needs a traceable evaluation so the qualified HR, leave, payroll, or policy reviewer can approve, conditionally approve, deny, pend, recode, extend, or route the requested absence under the current leave policy, scheduling rules, payroll controls, confidentiality requirements, and applicable leave obligations without relying on an informal email, spreadsheet, or unreviewed narrative.",
  "risk_tier": "C",
